function set {first} and {second} to value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("store", first, value)
        @intrinsic("store", second, value)
function set variable to value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("store", variable, value)
left and right means: @intrinsic("and", left, right)
@intrinsic("store", x, 7)
@intrinsic("store", y, 7)
set x and y to 8
to get fixed eight:
    @intrinsic("return", 8)
set x and y to fixed eight
@intrinsic("return", @intrinsic("subtract", @intrinsic("add", x, y), 16))
